<title>BRAZIL: BRAZIL CENBANK SELLS 189-DAY BBCS AT 2.289 PCT.</title>
<headline>BRAZIL CENBANK SELLS 189-DAY BBCS AT 2.289 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Central Bank sold 904 million reais of 189-day Central Bank Bonds (BBCs) Tuesday at an overnight call money rate of 2.289 percent a month, dealers said.</p>
<p>The rate at the bank's weekly formal bond auction was in line with market expectations.</p>
<p>The auction's result shows 904 million reais will be drained from the banking system as no old bonds are coming due Wednesday.</p>
<p>((--Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485418))</p>
